  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>'90s runner-inspired silhouette\nTextile upper with leather and synthetic overlays for a multi-textural look\nVisible Max Air heel unit for lasting cushioned comfort and heritage style\nPU foam midsole offers additional cushioning underfoot\nDurable rubber Waffle outsole provides reliable traction across surfaces\nThe Nike Air Max 90 is imported.\nThrow it back with a Nike classic! The Women's Nike Air Max 90 Casual Shoes are an icon of freshness with a legendary silhouette. These fashion-meets-comfort active lifestyle sneakers sport a '90s runner-inspired design complemented by a versatile color palette and feature plush cushioning you can only get from time-honored visible Air Max technology.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's Nike Air Max 90 Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Adult</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>White/White/Black</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>3103779</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 6